WEBVTT

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:14.610
Blade of the Immortal

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:17.030
One, two, three

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:21.330
Undead tree

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:23.750
What truth

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.420
I'll come true

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:34.590
Wow

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.470
I see that bright light

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:44.850
This is all I have

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:49.360
What did you say?
I know

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:53.900
Why do you say?

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:59.570
Hone the blade
Lie around

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:06.290
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:10.630
I got lost
I was lost

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:14.380
Survive of vision

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:17.680
Unfinished heaven

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:21.430
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:25.180
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:29.980
Survive of vision

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:58.170
And so Kagehisa Anotsu was pursued
by the shogunate's Rokki-dan...

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:20.030
Perhaps it was fate playing tricks, but I took it upon
myself to prevent their paths from crossing.

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:24.160
I do have one request of you.

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:27.910
We're planning to leave Edo.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.290
What? To where?

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:34.250
Satsuma is what I've told the officials.

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:36.460
In reality, it's a lie.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:40.050
I can only reveal that we will leave
Hitachi by boat.

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:42.380
Then I'll be going with you.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:44.640
The happenings of the Itto-ryu interest you?

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:49.220
Of course they do. I have the right
and obligation to know them.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:54.190
Very well. Follow me if you will.

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:56.270
There will be no hindrances.

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:01.110
So, what was this request of yours?

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:05.370
If you're coming with me,

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:08.200
I would insist you bring the Killer of 100.

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:16.040
An invitation to the Itto-ryu's
final showdown?

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:18.380
Things are really coming to a head.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.930
-It's done!
-Oh, my.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:27.720
Tada.

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:29.680
Who's that?

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:31.350
It's me!

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:37.270
Please... remember me with this picture.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.230
What? Oh, yeah.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:43.700
-But whose name is this?
-It's my real name!

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:46.320
Master, I've kept this a secret until now,

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:49.200
but Tanpopo and I are spies for the shogunate.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.710
Master, words cannot express the gratitude

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:58.000
for the patience you have shown for
two unworthy disciples such as ourselves.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:02.210
And while we realize the
impertinence of our actions,

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:06.140
the need has arisen for the two
of us to take a short trip together.

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:09.720
Master! In the event our trip ends
without casualty,

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:12.770
I would again
double my efforts as your disciple!

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:17.860
I will assist more than ever
with your everyday tasks.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:20.270
You two must have it rough.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:21.440
I understand.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:23.990
I'll be praying for your safe return.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:27.780
Master! I vow that I shall return.

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:30.080
I'm sorry that I must
postpone our engagement.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:33.080
Well, this is the first I've heard
of a wedding.

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:36.620
But this is quite the surprise.

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:39.880
To think that you still believed
your cover wasn't blown...

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:40.790
What?

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:46.510
-To be upfront, I--
-You're going on a journey?

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:49.890
-How did you know?
-Just a guess.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:09.570
If I said I'd go with you, would you forgive me?

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:13.290
If I leave, it's all over.

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:18.370
There will no longer be anyone
who'll drag you along the path of the sword.

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:23.710
Does your cruelty know no limits?

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:30.930
Something to gain, but possible to lose is so close.

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:35.770
In much the same way
as those many animals that cannot outlive people.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:38.270
I shall...

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:40.730
prove to you that...

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:44.940
I am not so weak a woman
as you would believe.

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:15.560
The Hebi squad reports that one part
of the Itto-ryu headed north from Matsudo

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:18.680
and entered Mitoji.

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:23.150
They will likely leave from Hitachi
by boat for Satsuma.

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:27.610
It's as long as five days from here to
the sea of Hitachi.

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:32.490
These will be the days that decide
our very fates.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:43.540
Shinada, how much of a lead do we
have on the Rokki-dan, roughly?

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:47.630
-I'd say about a day.
-That's what we're working with?

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:51.430
If I may say so,
I think a day's head start is big.

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:56.050
Especially since they'll have to
cross four rivers, just like we did.

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:58.220
Meaning they can't bring horses.

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:02.480
We can't be sure they won't chase
through the night, but it'd be reckless.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:07.820
Fools. Do not underestimate the
tenacity of one whose final hour is appointed.

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:10.740
We're changing our path!

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:18.660
Our task is to lure them about as long as possible,
making sure never to cross swords.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:22.620
-Therefore, we will--
-Don't you think this is a bit too passive for us?

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:27.130
He's right. With over 10 Itto-ryu
gathered together, running away is a strange move.

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:29.880
We may have only been worked hard
for eight days,

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:33.220
but I get the feeling that we've
made great strides!

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:37.470
How arrogant can you underlings
possibly be?

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:42.480
Don't get carried away telling yourself

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:44.900
you're already a bona fide Itto-ryu.

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:47.610
In those eight days,
was a single one of you able to

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:51.110
keep pace with me for even three moves?

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:55.660
You shouldn't be worried about the
Rokki-dan themselves.

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:59.870
The real terror is Kagimura Habaki.

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:03.830
Listen up, this is not a journey
during which your lives

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:06.120
will serve as shields
for our leader to escape.

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:09.630
It's a journey to ensure that the
flame of the Itto-ryu is not extinguished.

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:14.510
Our job is to make sure at least one
of you survives and makes it to the harbor.

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:19.100
To flee for such a cause brings me
no shame!

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:23.310
I'm tired of seeing the young die
before my eyes.

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:27.850
Just try dying before I do.
I'll kill you myself, I swear.

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:29.820
Mr. Abayama...

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:34.070
Abayama...

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:37.990
You're one embarrassing fellow.

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:39.280
Quiet, you!

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:45.330
I'm going to pay back my debtor.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:51.500
Lord Habaki?

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:59.640
Don't think you'll get off easy, baldy!

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:05.770
I know you haven't forgotten about
the child inside me.

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:07.100
Hyaku...

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:10.810
I'm not going to try raising a child without you.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:19.780
Kagehisa Anotsu isn't here.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:23.410
There doesn't seem to be a single
young commander among them.

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:26.120
I bet they've split up for some stratagem.

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:31.540
-We're going to keep this pace for a while.
-But I'm still exhausted.

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:35.630
Then there's no other option.
I'll carry you if it comes to it.

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:53.730
I hope you'll forgive me if I'm mistaken.

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:58.400
You girls are Mr. Habaki's spies,
are you not?

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:07.450
This journey is lacking any
semblance of fun.

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:08.460
What?

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:12.500
It's the wrong season for sight-seeing,
and we haven't encountered any swordsmen.

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:15.130
I might take Habaki's hospitality over this.

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:17.260
Cut it out with that talk.

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:22.510
Curse that whore.

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:25.890
Miss Meguro?

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:27.640
Rin?

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:31.140
Miss Meguro!

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:34.360
I'm fine. I just ran too hard.

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:38.940
More importantly, Tanpopo was hit by
a most likely poisoned shuriken.

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:44.200
Excuse me! Is there a doctor in this inn?

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:05.390
Here's some arrowroot soup.

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:06.510
Thank you.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.480
So you two are Kagimura Habaki's spies?

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:18.440
Hold on, why do you know that name?

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:23.030
Is your "Mr. Manji" the "Killer of
100 Mr. Manji"?

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:27.240
Which would make you
the daughter of the Asano dojo?

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:29.120
I really dropped the ball.

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:30.910
It took you long enough.

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:34.580
Did the Itto-ryu attack you?

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:38.800
No. The one who attacked us was
another shogunate spy.

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:41.920
Wait! I've got no reason to tell you
anything.

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:49.100
About back then...

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:51.220
Boy, does your head look cold.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:55.100
Have you repented
and begun some life-saving pilgrimage?

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:58.730
There's no redemption after what I've done.

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:04.820
True atonement is a much longer road.

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:07.530
In this country where the destitute and sick

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:10.660
have no options
but the good luck charm called medicine,

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:14.160
I will dedicate my life to laying
the groundwork of Western and Chinese medicine.

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:15.870
Nothing groundbreaking for me,

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:20.050
just a return to the resolve I had
before crossing over to the West.

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:23.170
That should be plenty.

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:27.300
You're a doctor. If you happen to
find success, it'll only mean you've done good.

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:34.270
I'm sworn to kill 1,000 evildoers
as atonement for killing 100.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:37.520
Isn't that a bit strange?

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.400
What?

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:42.650
Atoning for killing people with more killing?

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:47.320
You think I'm good for anything else?

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:50.330
Perhaps not if it's simply killing,

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:52.290
but you're not like that.

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:57.000
There's some reason your power of immortality
couldn't be replicated.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:01.130
As a doctor, saying this is maybe odd,

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:04.880
but within your immortality,
I perceived a clear force of will.

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:09.340
If people were given the power of
immortality for the sake of killing,

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:12.350
then it could only be the work of evil.

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:14.560
But that's not the case.

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:16.730
I want to believe that's not the case.

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:20.400
There's something you were meant to do.

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:26.400
You've come, Ozuhan.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.460
If you've any misgivings left,
say them now.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:40.380
It should only be you, since you've got a woman.

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:58.560
Hey, halt.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:07.320
What is it?

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:09.570
-I heard something outside.
-What?

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:12.570
You there!

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:14.160
Don't move!

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:24.460
All done.

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.720
No need for mercy.

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:34.050
Let us etch our infamy
in stone wholeheartedly.

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:37.850
-Who in the world?
-Don't space out.

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:39.100
Ready your bows.

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:47.940
Contact, contact!

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:27.020
Behold, Magatsu. The number of lights.

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:29.280
Across the moat is a hundred-man
guardhouse.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:32.490
Baro and Ozuhan are heading there now.

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:35.200
Beyond the Kuichigai gate
is another guardhouse.

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:37.120
What a path you've chosen for us.

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:39.490
Hey, master...

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:41.660
Don't tell me you're starting to
feel yourself.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.120
Here we go.

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:49.920
Already, over 20 from the Kosho and
Kojunin squads have been killed.

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:51.920
They're here!

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:54.180
Do not falter. We stand together!

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:17.820
We're good to go.

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:32.340
-Contact, contact!
-Hurry! This way!

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:33.880
This is the crucial point.

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:36.760
Past here is the center, then?

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:07.460
Captain of the Oban squad,
Nizaemon Kumokiri.

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:10.920
Captain of the Kosho squad, Kai Kiryuin.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:14.380
It would seem you curs have come
to play with us.

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:16.840
The Itto-ryu spoken of in rumors...

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:19.890
No matter how many you've slain,
you're still worthless little...

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:33.730
So we're at the center.

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:37.490
You bastards!

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:39.030
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:42.780
What? What have you done?

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:46.700
Was your promise to depart Edo
just a part of your scheme?

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.870
There were things left unfinished.

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.540
I won't allow any more of this savagery!

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:54.000
What do you plan to do
with just three of you?

00:18:55.550 --> 00:18:58.760
We are not three, but four.

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:05.810
Nobody move!

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:11.100
Otherwise, you'll lose your Oban, Kosho
and Shinban captains all in the same night.

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:14.820
Magatsu.

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:16.990
Do I really have to do it?

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:29.790
Did I get all the characters right?

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:32.040
That's perfect.

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:34.090
Now, Mr. Hanabusa.

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:36.500
Would you kindly read it aloud?

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:41.890
"Guards in the castle, Shogun's escorts.

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:44.100
Subjugators of imperial enemies.

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:46.060
The teaching of swordplay:

00:19:46.140 --> 00:19:50.100
all shall be made to undertake it

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:51.730
by the Itto-ryu."

00:19:57.030 --> 00:19:58.280
Mr. Hanabusa.

00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:02.610
If you commanded the Itto-ryu be cut
down along with yourself,

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:04.910
that would spell the end of us.

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:12.290
You, what do you hope to gain from this?

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:17.300
Since the day I inherited the
Itto-ryu from my grandfather,

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:21.970
I have toiled without rest to make
it a fang of the shogunate.

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:26.180
Perhaps to that end,
I've thrown a bit of caution to the wind.

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:30.100
The result is as you already well know.

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:34.560
Do you understand now the depth of
our devotion?

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:36.310
We then thought,

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:39.530
for useless men like us to become
fangs to protect the nation,

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:42.240
we should become a poison which
would threaten it.

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:43.660
What?

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:46.450
Are you aware, Mr. Hanabusa?

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:49.370
A body that has once endured a poisoning,

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:52.750
will be rebuilt sturdier than
before it was poisoned.

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:57.630
Mr. Hanabusa, I pray that none of you

00:20:57.710 --> 00:21:01.380
ever forget the grizzly sight
you have seen here today.

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:04.510
The futility and disgrace of being powerless

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:09.930
along with the rage at seeing your
dead comrades should be recalled ad infinitum.

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:14.940
That is the heartfelt wish of we who
would leave Edo before the day's end.

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:19.360
Now, Mr. Hanabusa...

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:25.740
-Lord Hanabusa!
-Lord Hanabusa!

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:27.740
Hurry and pull out Lord Hanabusa!

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:30.080
Riflemen, don't let them escape!

00:22:51.740 --> 00:22:55.700
Act Nineteen - Massacre

00:22:59.830 --> 00:23:01.250
Where is Ozuhan?

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:06.010
I lost sight of him, but he's not
the type to die.

00:23:08.050 --> 00:23:11.760
The two of you must continue over
this wall to Hanzomon.

00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:13.470
What are you saying?

00:23:16.100 --> 00:23:17.560
Baro...

00:23:17.640 --> 00:23:19.390
There's no time.

00:23:19.480 --> 00:23:22.360
Leave the task of distraction to me.

00:23:22.440 --> 00:23:25.480
Mr. Abayama is waiting for you in Mitoji.

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:29.320
Mr. Magatsu, I entrust our leader to you.

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:37.450
May we meet again in Nirvana.
